## Explanation

This diagram shows the **MVP scope** (what's specified for SIH demo) vs **Post-MVP** and **Research** directions.

### MVP Scope (Phases 0-8, SIH Demo Ready)

| Component | Status | Implementation |
|-----------|--------|----------------|
| **Language** | ✅ Specified | Pest grammar, AST, type checker, IR compiler |
| **Execution Contract** | ✅ Specified | Contract builder, policy engine, capability validation |
| **Runtime** | ✅ Specified | Sequential/parallel dispatch, timeout/retry, isolation |
| **Evidence Model** | ✅ Specified | 7 types, ULIDs, blake3, Ed25519, provenance chain |
| **Windows Collectors** | ✅ Specified | 5 collectors (proc, file, reg, logs, net) |
| **Linux Collectors** | ✅ Specified | 5 collectors (proc, file, config, logs, net) |
| **Correlation** | ✅ Specified | 9 rules, petgraph, queries, hypothesis overlay |
| **API** | ✅ Specified | Axum REST + WebSocket, OpenAPI |
| **Frontend** | ✅ Specified | 8 pages, Cytoscape, Chart.js, Kanban |
| **Export** | ✅ Specified | CASE/UCO, Cytoscape, Timesketch, Markdown |
| **CLI** | ✅ Specified | run, compile, graph, verify, export |

### Post-MVP (Phases 9-15, After SIH)

| Feature | Description | Effort | Dependencies |
|---------|-------------|--------|--------------|
| **eBPF Collectors** | Aya-based syscall/socket/file tracing | High | Kernel 5.10+, BTF/CO-RE |
| **Kernel Drivers** | Windows ETW kernel, minifilter | Very High | Driver signing, WHQL |
| **Remote Agents** | gRPC/mTLS, capability negotiation | High | Agent binary, enrollment |
| **Multi-tenancy** | Orgs, RBAC, data isolation | Medium | AuthZ, PostgreSQL |
| **AI Assist** | Local LLM for hypothesis/timeline | Medium | llama.cpp, GGUF models |
| **Collaboration** | CRDT-based multi-analyst | High | Yjs/Automerge, WebRTC |
| **Cloud Collection** | AWS/Azure/GCP snapshot APIs | Medium | Cloud SDKs, IAM |
| **Container Forensics** | Docker/containerd/K8s artifacts | Medium | CRI, K8s API |
| **Mobile Forensics** | iOS/Android backup parsing | High | libimobiledevice, ADB |
| **Formal Verification** | Prusti/Kani proofs for IR | Very High | Rust verification tools |

### Research Directions (Exploratory)

| Feature | Description | Maturity |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **WASM Plugins** | Sandboxed, portable collector extensions | Experimental |
| **Distributed Execution** | Multi-target coordination, aggregation | Research |
| **Query Optimization** | IR rewrite rules, collector pushdown | Research |
| **Differential Investigation** | Compare runs, highlight deltas | Research |
| **Evidence Notarization** | Blockchain/trusted timestamping | Research |
| **Legal Hold** | Automated preservation workflows | Research |
| **Threat Intel Fusion** | Real-time IOC enrichment | Research |

### Decision Criteria for Post-MVP

| Criterion | Threshold |
|-----------|-----------|
| **User Demand** | >3 SIH judges/mentors request |
| **Technical Feasibility** | Prototype in <2 weeks |
| **Security Impact** | No new attack surface |
| **Maintenance Burden** | <5% of codebase |
| **Alignment** | Supports Evidence-Contract USP |